the line you would be able to tell that

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:36.600
it was that specific character because
they should have a specific voice and

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:41.400
yeah if you have a character who needs
validation and every sentence you know

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:46.710
